  "question": "What fast food restaurant can I find within 90 kilometers when heading from Taylor's Aquarium, Dunn, NC toward Independent Light Infantry Museum, Fayetteville, NC?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.589533 35.200429)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.880747 35.054291)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.589533 35.200429)',4326)::geography, 90000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.589533 35.200429)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
